coherent with its stated purpose and shows no hidden execution, exfiltration, or privilege escalation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The only environment interaction described is writing generated output under creative-thoughts/session-{timestamp}.md, which is proportionate for a session export workflow.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains only a Markdown SKILL.md file, with no scripts, dependencies, remote payloads, or install-time actions.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The invocation description is broad for creative exploration and writing/product ideation, but it remains tied to user-directed idea exploration rather than unrelated agent control.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill instructs the agent to save a narrative summary and full transcript after sufficient insights are produced; this is disclosed in the artifact but should be made clear to users before saving sensitive ideas.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is conversational creative ideation, pattern spotting, paradox hunting, naming concepts, and summarizing insights; the instructions stay within that creative thought-partner role.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill is designed to guide a probing creative conversation and then save a session file that can include the full transcript. Avoid using it for confidential business plans, private personal reflections, or sensitive drafts unless you are comfortable with that local saved record, or ask the agent not to export the session.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad creative-ideation trigger could cause the skill to be used in many brainstorming contexts, but the scope still matches the stated creative thought-partner purpose and does not add unrelated authority.\n[SQP-2] expected: Saving a full transcript is part of the declared session export behavior, but users should be aware before sharing proprietary, personal, or confidential ideas.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789021781192}}}}}